          "page": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {"type": "heading", "text": "Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis", "size": 13},
            {"type": "heading", "text": "Overview", "size": 11},
            {"type": "paragraph", "id": "en_mdna_1", "text": "Chengchuan Smart Manufacturing designs and manufactures intelligent equipment and precision components for battery, semiconductor and automotive customers. Total revenue for fiscal 2025 was $176.5 million, an increase of 9.3% compared with fiscal 2024, driven primarily by higher product shipments to battery customers."},
            {"type": "paragraph", "id": "en_mdna_2", "text": "Gross margin improved to 42.6% from 41.3% in the prior year as a result of a more favorable product mix and lower freight costs. Income from operations nearly doubled to $14.6 million."},
            {"type": "heading", "text": "Results of Operations", "size": 11},
            {"type": "paragraph", "id": "en_mdna_4", "text": "The following table sets forth our consolidated results of operations for the periods presented. Percentages that are not meaningful are shown as n/m."},
            {"type": "table", "table": "en_ops", "part": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "blocks": [
            {"type": "table", "table": "en_ops", "part": 1},
            {"type": "heading", "text": "Liquidity and Capital Resources", "size": 11},
            {"type": "paragraph", "id": "en_mdna_3", "text": "As of December 31, 2025, we had cash and cash equivalents of $63.4 million. We believe that existing cash, together with cash generated from operations, will be sufficient to meet our working capital and capital expenditure needs for at least the next 12 months."}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
